      <span class="title">Desk lamp</span>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="label">POWER</span>
        <span class="state" id="state">ON</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hint" id="hint">Press the lamp to switch it off.</span>
      <span class="sub">Shade, arm, base and round button all work.</span>
